  "content": "[Intro]\n[Adim]  [C7]  [Abm]\nYou're\n[Am]in for surprise\nYou're\nin for a shock\nIn\nLondon town\nstreets When there's\ndarkness and fog\nWhen\n[C]you least [G]expect\nme And\n[F]you turn your [Em]back I'll at-\n[Am]tack\nI\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]smile when I'm sneaking\nThrough\nshadows by the wall\nI\nlaugh when I'm creeping\nBut\nyou won't hear me at all\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]All hear my [G]war-\nning\n[F]Never turn your [Em]back On the\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]ripper [Bm][Em]\n[D][C][Cm]You'll\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]soon shake with fear\nNever know-\ning if I'm near\nI'm\nsly and I'm shame-\nless Noc-\nturnal and name-\nless Ex-\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]cept for \"The [G]Ripper\"\n[F]Or if you [Em]like \"Jack The\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]Knife\" [Bm][Em]\n[D]  [C]  [Cm]\n[Am]  [Bm]  [Em]\n[D]  [C]  [Cm]\n[Am]  [Bm]  [Em]\n[D]  [C]  [Cm]\n[Bm]  [Csus2]\n\n[Solo]\n[Em]\n[D]\n[Am]\n[Cm]  [Bm]  [Abm]\n[Am]  [G]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Em]\n[Am]\n[Em]\n[Am]\n[Fm]\n[Bbm]\n[Gbm]\n[Bm]\n[Gm]\n[Abm]\n[Am]  [Bbm]\n[Bm]  [Em]\n[Em]\n[Am]\n[Em]\n[Am]Any\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Am]back alley street\nIs where\nwe'll probably meet\nUnder-\nneath a gas lamp\nWhere the\nair's cold and damp\nI'm a\n[Asus2]nasty surpri-\nse I'm a\n[E/A]devil in disguise\nI'm a\n[A7sus2]footstep at night\nI'm a\n[Asus2]scream of the fright\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]All hear my [G]war-\nning\n[F]Never turn your [Em]back On the\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]ripper, [Bm][Em]\n[D][C][Cm]the\n[Am]ripper, [Bm][Em]\n[D][C][Cm]the\n[Am]ripper [Bm][Em]\n[D]  [C]  [Cm]\n[Bm]  [Csus2]  [Em]\n[Am]",
